  (defn __rhtml-output-meta [output : int] #fx{Unsafe} : cstr
    ```c
    typedef struct {
      char *cell_id;
      int64_t status;
      char *stdout_text;
      char *value_repr;
      char *error_msg;
      int64_t elapsed_ms;
      int64_t image_paths;
      char *type_tag;
